  "question": {
    "text": "The point at which the line segment joining <math><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5,5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> subtends an obtuse angle is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7,7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Equation of the circle assuming <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> as the diameter is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Now, for point <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and circle <math><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math></p><p>if <math><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> lies inside the circle <math><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and at this point diameter of&nbsp;the circle subtends an obtuse angle.<br />Now, from options, we get,&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is the required point</p>"
  }
